<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Tuticorin cargoes - April 10.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Tuticorin cargoes - April 10.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule of major vessels loading and unloading at India's Tuticorin port on April 10:</p>
<p> Commodity	    Tons/TEUS		   Ship	  Berthing</p>
<p>		   (LDD/ULD) (Balance)</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Salt	     1,407/--- (LDD) 2,700/---   Al Nasar	  06/04</p>
<p>Caustic Soda   3,524/--- (LDD)   976/---   Man 'O'Steel    06/04</p>
<p>General	    ---/147 (LDD)   ---/---   Jeya Ceres	10/04</p>
<p>General	    ---/186 (ULD)   ---/207   Orient Mumbai   09/04</p>
<p>Urea	     3,480/--- (ULD)21,215/---   Lena-II	   06/04</p>
<p>Coal	     2,900/--- (ULD)20,262/---   Padali Puthra   09/04</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>		  Note:</p>
<p>	    LDD - Loading</p>
<p>	    ULD - Unloading</p>
<p>(Source: J.M.Baxi &amp; Co, Tuticorin)</p>
